# Search

The search box of the top bar uses [Pagefind](https://pagefind.app). Its index is built
after the site, from the generated pages:

```sh
lhtml-site
python -m pip install pagefind[extended]
python -m pagefind --site .site
```

The index is written in `.site/pagefind/`. The search works when the site is served over
http (`python -m http.server -d .site`), not from a file opened on the disk. The keys `/`
and Ctrl+K (Cmd+K) go to the search box; the arrows choose a result.
